<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for Spain.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for Spain.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Spain:</p>
<p>				     1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 2.1	  2.7</p>
<p> Investment			 7.3	  8.4</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     3.6	  2.9</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    22.0	 21.5</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  4.4	  3.0</p>
<p> (pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  67.8	 67.1</p>
</text>
